       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. Sort.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TEMP PIC 9(3).
       01 I PIC 9(3).
       01 J PIC 9(3).
       01  NUMBERS-TABLE.
           05  Arr OCCURS 100 TIMES
               INDEXED BY IDX
               PIC 9(3).
