           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 100
               PERFORM VARYING J FROM I BY 1 UNTIL J > 100
                   IF Arr(I) > Arr(J)
                       MOVE Arr(I) TO TEMP
                       MOVE Arr(J) TO Arr(I)
                       MOVE TEMP   TO Arr(J)
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
           END-PERFORM.
       STOP RUN.
